umber": 12, "points": 1, "type": "computation", "answer": "y = sqrt(5|x|-5). Domain: |x|>=5, so x>=5 or x<=-5. D=(-∞,-5)∪(-5,5)∪(5,+∞) [corrected: |x|>=1 i.e. x in (-∞,-5]∪[5,+∞)]", "scoring_notes": "Correct domain condition 0.5, correct intervals 0.5"}, {"number": 13, "points": 1.5, "type": "computation", "answer": "x = 3", "scoring_notes": "Correct solution with numerator=0 check 0.5, domain check 0.5, identified extraneous root 0.5"}, {"number": 14, "points": 1.5, "type": "computation", "answer": "a2 = 9, d = 4", "scoring_notes": "Found d 1.0, found a2 0.5"}, {"number": 15, "points": 2, "type": "essay", "answer": "Derive formula: am-ak = a1+(m-1)d - (a1+(k-1)d) = d(m-k), therefore d = (am-ak)/(m-k)", "scoring_notes": "Expanded am 0.5, expanded ak 0.5, subtraction step 0.5, derived formula 0.5"}]'::jsonb, NULL, '1zkqDpw89inqeqYM9zDIpfrzkfgCrJnXTrw0CTs6eJYw')
